{
  "name": "xiaofeiyu-whale",
  "version": "0.2.0",
  "description": "小肥鱼鲸鱼娘：独立记忆插件（0.2.0 起含「待确认」记忆与协议适配层）。托管 Python SQLite 记忆库，侧边栏查看统计、事实、摘要与检索结果；DSH 启动即自动运行，并与「爱ai」通过规范 JSONL 自动双向联通，两边面板各有一个总开关。纯记忆功能，不含任何人设或角色设定。",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": true,
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/host/index.mjs",
    "./client": "./src/client/index.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg"
  },
  "files": [
    "src",
    "python",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "locale",
    "README.md",
    "VERSION",
    "install.mjs",
    "uninstall.mjs",
    "verify.mjs",
    "selfcheck.mjs",
    "test",
    "LICENSE",
    "PURE.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true
    }
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=22"
  },
  "pureBuild": {
    "personaData": false,
    "builtAt": "2026-11-18T04:27:11.629Z",
